<title>USA: HUGHES SUPPLY COMPLETES ACQUISITION.</title>
<headline>HUGHES SUPPLY COMPLETES ACQUISITION.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Supply Inc said Friday it has completed its acquisition of Shrader Holding Co Inc.</p>
<p>The deal for Shrader, a wholesale distributor of water and sewer supplies, was effective August 4.</p>
<p>Hughes Supply said that Ronnie Shrader, the former owner of Shrader, will continue to manage the business.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
